{"version":1,"content":"<p>林寶玉近日動作多多，除了擔任姚正菁經理人外，更獲邀成為亞洲心動娛樂首席營運官COO，負責管理及投資影視、娛樂項目，除早前女團選拔外，早前在首爾舉行泰劇《宿敵戀人》粉絲見面會，劇中演員盛裝出席，吸引不少韓迷前往朝聖。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:21:46.065991+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:35:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:39:42.391699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:14.439026+00:00","content_hash":"03a83327b104f940b36371c343ed4b7ff0d045753d4b537e81e475a3203954d3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}